'''Rick''' is an [[NPC]] located in {{zone|Spider's Den}}, inside the {{Zone|Gravel Mines}}. They give out the {{Quest|The Flint Bros}} quest.

== Quest ==
'''Rick''' asks for {{Item|Iron Ingot|amount=2}}s in exchange for a {{Item|Promising Shovel}}, as part of the {{Quest|The Flint Bros}} recipe.

