== Trivia ==
* His brother is {{NPCSprite|Pat}}, who is located at the {{zone|Graveyard}}. They are referred to as the "Flint Brothers" or "Flint Bros".
**According to {{NPCSprite|Pat}}'s dialogue, '''Rick''' mines the {{Item|Gravel}}, and {{NPCSprite|Pat}} then sells it.

